      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Boulder Ridge is the older Disney Vacation Club wing at Wilderness Lodge. Studios sleep five; one-bedroom villas sleep four; two-bedroom villas sleep eight. You share the lodge's boat to Magic Kingdom, the restaurants, Copper Creek Springs Pool and the quieter Boulder Ridge Cove Pool.</p>
